sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Ops admin
  participant UI as Ops app /payouts/[id]
  participant API as /internal/payouts
  participant PC as Paycrest
  participant B as Base RPC
  participant DB as Postgres

  S->>UI: open a needs_review payout
  UI->>API: GET /payouts/:id (details, ledger, audit trail)
  opt re-fetch
    UI->>API: POST /refetch
    API->>PC: getOrder
    API->>DB: forward-only syncPayoutOrder + audit payout.refetched
  end
  UI->>API: POST /resolve/prepare (paid or failed)
  API->>PC: order evidence
  API->>B: transaction evidence
  API->>DB: staff_confirmations row (intent hash, 5 min)
  API-->>UI: confirmation token
  S->>UI: second confirmation
  UI->>API: POST /resolve/confirm
  API->>DB: payout paid or failed, optional missing ledger debit, subject hooks, audit payout.resolved
